{"title": "Book of Dead Gods", "pageid": 3843, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Book_of_Dead_Gods", "categories": ["Transcripts", "Books", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Tome_E_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Book_Tome_E_Image.png/300px-Book_Tome_E_Image.png.webp, /w/images/8/84/Book_Tome_E_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Book of Dead Gods image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Book_Tome_E_Image.png/300px-Book_Tome_E_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Book_Tome_E_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Book of Dead Gods</b> records the names of current and past <a href=\"/wiki/Deities\" title=\"Deities\">deities</a>, and is written by an unknown author.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A hefty, gold-embossed tome, listing gods immemorial.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Books\" title=\"Books\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/25px-Books_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/38px-Books_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/50px-Books_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Books\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/25px-Books_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Books_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Books\" title=\"Books\">Books</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Author: unknown\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Author: unknown</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-36365885ee4275f7END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-be6924a7d737e546END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_CHA_Crypt_BookOfRestoredGods</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_CHA_Crypt_BookOfRestoredGods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_CHA_Crypt_BookOfRestoredGods\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">a480a240-b8ea-4e6a-b4b9-a8edc8fd4a3d</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a480a240-b8ea-4e6a-b4b9-a8edc8fd4a3d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:a480a240-b8ea-4e6a-b4b9-a8edc8fd4a3d\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Dank_Crypt\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dank Crypt\">Dank Crypt</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-321&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-269</span></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Opening_the_Book\">Opening the Book</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Narrator</dt><dd>*This book is far lighter than it should be with such a massive lock.*</dd></dl>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[ARCANA]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Search for an arcane rune to sabotage.</i>&nbsp;(DC 15)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[STRENGTH]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Smash the lock open.</i>&nbsp;(DC 15)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[WIZARD]&nbsp;[INTELLIGENCE]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Knock the lock open with a spell.&nbsp;(DC 10)</i></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[WARLOCK]&nbsp;[CHARISMA]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Channel your patron's strength into the lock.</i>&nbsp;(DC 10)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[SORCERER]&nbsp;[CHARISMA]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Master your will and channel a surge of magic through the lock.</i>&nbsp;(DC 10)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[CLERIC]&nbsp;[WISDOM]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Channel a spark of divine power into the lock.</i>&nbsp;(DC 10)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[PALADIN]&nbsp;[WISDOM]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Channel the magic spark of your oath through the lock.</i>&nbsp;(DC 10)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[BERSERKER]&nbsp;[STRENGTH]&nbsp;</span></span><i><b>Drown in fury - SHATTER THE LOCK.</b></i>&nbsp;(DC 15&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/20px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/30px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/40px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/20px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[BARBARIAN]&nbsp;[STRENGTH]&nbsp;</span></span><i>The lock is begging to be smashed. Oblige it.</i>&nbsp;(DC 15&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/20px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/30px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/40px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/20px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>)</span>\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Narrator</dt><dd>*As the lock opens, a loose page comes with it. Magic pulses from the parchment.*</dd></dl></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[SORCERER]&nbsp;</span></span>Narrator: *As the lock opens, weak magic pulses from the book. Such a waste, binding it to dry, dead parchment.*</span>\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Narrator</dt><dd>*What was once script is now an obliterated scrawl. You have a sense these are names, a list, but of what?*</dd></dl>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-option\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-tags\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-physical\">[RELIGION]&nbsp;</span></span><i>Examine the book more closely.</i>&nbsp;(DC 10)</span>\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Narrator</dt><dd>*Gods. These are names of gods, once lost, but now restored after the Second Sundering.*</dd></dl>\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Narrator</dt><dd>*The last three names in this book sit close together, but are so devastated by the scrawl as to be unreadable.*&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-condition\"><i>(after a passive DC 10 Investigation roll)</i></span></dd></dl></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Attempting the <a href=\"/wiki/Religion\" title=\"Religion\">Religion</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Check</a> when reading the book produces a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Ray_of_Enfeeblement\" title=\"Scroll of Ray of Enfeeblement\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Scroll_of_Ray_of_Enfeeblement_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Ray_of_Enfeeblement_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Scroll_of_Ray_of_Enfeeblement_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Scroll_of_Ray_of_Enfeeblement_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e6/Scroll_of_Ray_of_Enfeeblement_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Scroll_of_Ray_of_Enfeeblement_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e6/Scroll_of_Ray_of_Enfeeblement_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Scroll_of_Ray_of_Enfeeblement_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e6/Scroll_of_Ray_of_Enfeeblement_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Ray_of_Enfeeblement\" title=\"Scroll of Ray of Enfeeblement\">Scroll of Ray of Enfeeblement</a>, even if the check fails.</li>\n<li>Characters with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sage\" title=\"Sage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png/20px-Background_Sage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png/30px-Background_Sage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png/40px-Background_Sage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png/20px-Background_Sage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sage\" title=\"Sage\">Sage</a> background like <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a> gain the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sage#Secrets_of_the_Sundering\" title=\"Sage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Secrets of the Sundering\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Sage#Secrets_of_the_Sundering\" title=\"Sage\">Secrets of the Sundering</a> inspiration.</li>\n<li>Characters with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte\" title=\"Acolyte\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png/20px-Background_Acolyte_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png/30px-Background_Acolyte_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png/40px-Background_Acolyte_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Acolyte\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png/20px-Background_Acolyte_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2f/Background_Acolyte_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte\" title=\"Acolyte\">Acolyte</a> background like <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a> receive the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte#Divinity_Undone\" title=\"Acolyte\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Divinity Undone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte#Divinity_Undone\" title=\"Acolyte\">Divinity Undone</a> inspiration.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[The names of dead gods - most of them unfamiliar and unpronounceable - fill the pages of this ancient tome. Several entries on the last page have been stricken through, the final three thoroughly enough to be completely illegible.]\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The generic Strength check to open the book can still be attempted even after trying and failing one of the class-specific options.</li>\n<li>The three names mentioned in the Investigation check are a possible reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Dead_Three\" title=\"Dead Three\">Dead Three</a>.</li>\n<li>It is also possible to lockpick <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;10 Sleight of Hand Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;10 <a href=\"/wiki/Sleight_of_Hand\" title=\"Sleight of Hand\">Sleight of Hand</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> the book from the inventory and then read it afterward, to get the Scroll of Ray of Enfeeblement, without any of the dialogue above</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Book_of_Dead_Gods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Book of Dead Gods\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Book_of_Dead_Gods\">Book of Dead Gods</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202047\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.097 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.101 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4278/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 53409/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 21673/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.026/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1221816/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.0